# SecureTunnel Gateway - .gitignore
# 目標：絕不讓私鑰、真實設定、憑證或建置產物進入版本控制。

# --- Secrets / Keys (最重要) ---
*.key
*.pem
*.p12
*.pfx
server.key
server-private.key
**/keys/
**/secrets/
.env
*.env
!.env.example

# --- 真實設定檔（只保留 .example 範例） ---
config/gateway.yaml
config/peers.yaml
config/peers.json
config/protected-resources.yaml

# --- Peer Registry (real runtime data, contains real Client public keys) ---
*.peers.json
peers.json
!config/peers.example.json

# --- Resource / Policy Registry (real runtime data) ---
config/resources.json
config/policies.json
resources.json
policies.json
!config/resources.example.json
!config/policies.example.json

# --- Generated firewall rulesets (real runtime data / working files) ---
*.conf.candidate
*.conf.lastknowngood
securetunnel.conf

# --- Generated Client configuration templates (never commit even though they're
#     placeholders - operators may paste a real private key into the copy on disk) ---
*.client.conf

# --- WireGuard 真實設定（只保留 deploy/wireguard/*.conf.example） ---
deploy/wireguard/*.conf
!deploy/wireguard/*.conf.example

# --- Logs / Audit ---
*.log
logs/

# --- Backups ---
*.tar.gz
*backup*.tar.gz

# --- .NET build artifacts ---
bin/
obj/
publish/
*.user
*.suo

# --- Test / coverage artifacts ---
TestResults/
*.trx
coverage/

# --- OS / Editor ---
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.vs/
.vscode/
.idea/

# --- Docker / test-lab local overrides ---
docker-compose.override.yml
test-lab/**/*.local.yml

# --- Claude Code local files (session recovery points, project instructions) ---
.claude_recovery/
CLAUDE.md
.claude/

# --- Internal dev/security docs kept local only, not published to GitHub ---
SECURITY.md
CONTRIBUTING.md
docs/
